; Sums are exact inside and rounded half to even to ten places once, when they are given: units
; included, valued or not. a is a tie (0.12345678905) and rounds to the even digit; c adds two
; amounts that are 0 once rounded alone (4e-11 + 4e-11 = 8e-11, which is 1e-10); e is a negative
; tie; g mixes an amount at a cost with plain ones; k is 5e-11 less 5e-11 plus 3e-11.
